      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>As far as we can tell, this dedication of a new home or “prayer on entering a new habiration” by Rabbi Isaac Henry Myers of Ramsgate was first published in Hester Rothschild’s 1855 translation of <tei:hi rend="italic">Imrei Lev</tei:hi> (1848), a collection of teḥinot in French by Rabbi Arnaud Aron and Jonas Ennery (in which this prayer is absent). Rabbi Myers own home was built by Sir Moses Montefiore.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_29151_notes"/>
